DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The uurree driver supports the Realtek USB Ethernet Controller family.

     The uurree driver supports the following media types:

     aauuttoosseelleecctt   Enable auto selection of the media type and options.  The
                  user can manually override the auto selected mode by adding
                  media options to the _/_e_t_c_/_r_c_._c_o_n_f file.

     1100bbaasseeTT//UUTTPP  Set 10Mbps operation.  The mmeeddiiaaoopptt option can also be used
                  to select either ffuullll--dduupplleexx or hhaallff--dduupplleexx modes.

     110000bbaasseeTTXX    Set 100Mbps (Fast Ethernet) operation.  The mmeeddiiaaoopptt option
                  can also be used to select either ffuullll--dduupplleexx or hhaallff--dduupplleexx
                  modes.

     11000000bbaasseeTTXX   Set 1000baseTX (Gigabit Ethernet) operation over twisted
                  pair.  The Realtek gigE chips support 1000Mbps in
                  ffuullll--dduupplleexx mode only.

     22550000bbaassee--TT   Set 2500Base-T operation over twisted pair.  The Realtek
                  8156/8156B chips support 2500Mbps in ffuullll--dduupplleexx mode only.

     The uurree driver supports the following media options for 10/100 operation:

     ffuullll--dduupplleexx  Force full-duplex operation.

     hhaallff--dduupplleexx  Force half-duplex operation.

     For more information on configuring this device, see ifconfig(8).

HHAARRDDWWAARREE
     The uurree driver supports the following USB Ethernet controllers:

     Model:                                          Speed (Mbps):
     Realtek RTL8156/RTL8156B/RTL8156BG              10, 100, 1000, and 2500
     Realtek RTL8153/RTL8153B                        10, 100, and 1000
     Realtek RTL8152                                 10 and 100
     Realtek RTL8168/8169/8110/8211 via rgephy(4)    10, 100, and 1000

